I'M SORRY

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.130
Shingyoto-ryu, Ibane School.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:48.130
I don't know the specific location either.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.760
You should stop by when you arrive in Kaga.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.220
A mountain path is a long way for just one woman.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.800
Keep your wits about you.

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:05.520
Blade of the Immortal

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.940
One, two, three

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.650
Undead tree

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.650
What truth

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:18.370
I'll come true

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:25.500
Wow...

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:29.380
I see that bright light

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.760
This is all I have

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:40.260
What did you say?
I know

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:44.810
Why do you say?

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:50.480
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:57.450
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:01.530
I got lost
I was lost

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:05.290
Survive of vision

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.580
Unfinished heaven

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.340
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.090
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:20.890
Survive of vision

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.230
OHARA TEA SHOP

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:33.190
I'm such an incredibly self-centered girl.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:35.990
I was the one who asked for a bodyguard.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.360
-Thanks, it was great!
-Right.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.080
I'll leave the payment here.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.910
That's okay.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.370
How courteous of you.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:13.650
10 RYO REWARD FOR THESE TWO

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.190
What a waste.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.030
What are you talking about?

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:19.400
Even if I wasn't so wounded,

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:24.120
would a man of poor rapport like yourself
ever get to bed a beauty like this?

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.580
You're not wrong.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.370
Speaking of an injured prostitute...
Looks like it was for sport.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:33.630
Not to mention it was in this neighborhood.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.960
Yeah, two medicine salesmen were torn up, right?

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.380
The one prostitute lost a leg,

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:40.930
and is barely hanging on.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.950
Honestly, I've been feeling gloomy.

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:02.950
I don't want to be attacked in the street.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:04.160
That wasn't me--

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.080
So you can't say,

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.330
"It wasn't us"?

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.700
The one who did it

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.500
was the tall man who was with us, named Shira.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.540
That man is even acting as an accuser...

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.130
They just know...

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:22.550
-What?
-Crazy people like him.

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:27.260
I've been chasing after revenge for my parents.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:29.890
To that end,

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.850
I joined up with a maniac like him.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:36.110
That's...something I can never take back.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.190
So, what is it you want to do?

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:44.950
Thank you.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:48.620
This cup of barley tea really means a lot.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.460
I've got a soft spot for troubled girls.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.630
That's gotten me into trouble before.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:04:59.500
Excuse me.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.630
Do you remember what we talked about last time?

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.470
The way for any person to slip through the gate.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.390
I want to try it out.

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:25.240
Kaminagafusa Village.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.700
Close to the Kobotoke River.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.950
That's where you'll find it.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.370
Is anyone here?

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:37.830
-Is anyone--?
-I'm here.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:39.460
Here I am.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:41.500
Welcome.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.010
Some sake...

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.760
wouldn't be good.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.470
Hey, Sato! Some barley tea!

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:50.100
Now, now, I'm sure you're tired.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.430
I'll draw a bath right away.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.060
Yes.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.850
I am about to cross the gate after all.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:06:01.900
So you want to wash off the Edo dust
before getting on the main road?

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:03.280
Yes.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.860
-Go ahead.
-Thank you.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:12.080
I hear the guard of the Kobotoke Gate
has meals in this village.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.120
Here and in the neighboring Shimonagafusa Village.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.160
If you're looking for something good to eat,

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.250
you can just ask us.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.800
And if there's anything else you need,
please let us know.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:23.880
Then...

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.220
I'll ask right away.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.130
What is it?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.640
Would you please

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.390
take me in as a foster daughter?

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.890
I was told

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.400
many things by a certain person.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.770
The officials know the faces

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.490
of the people of this village

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:48.990
from being off-duty.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:51.320
If I'm a resident of Kaminagafusa,

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:54.950
I won't need any passes at all to go through the gate.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.580
Not only that, if you would

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.420
announce at the gate that either we're related, married,

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.880
or even that I'm adopted,

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.630
I can repay you in kind.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.630
Furthermore,

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.840
I hear there are criminals who will pretend
to be your family

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.560
as well as people who will act as a guide for a price.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:20.350
Please. I will, of course, show my gratitude.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:26.020
I'd gotten all excited that you were a real customer.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.320
Sorry, but you're a number of years too late.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.820
We've washed our hands of that already.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.660
Twenty-one ryo.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.120
That's everything I can give you.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:43.500
Miss, we aren't saying this

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:47.710
to squeeze more money out of you.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.550
There is, of course, a reason we stopped.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.550
I'll never forget it. Three years ago,

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.510
a young girl came here alone.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:08:00.140
We heard her story, that she was a runaway prostitute,

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.100
and wanted to see her parents back home

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:06.730
before she was caught.
So she handed us a pitiable sum of money.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:09.650
Giving her our sympathy was perhaps
the fateful decision.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:12.200
We screwed it up and got caught.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:16.240
The result, our inn was soon shut down,

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.660
The girl was charged with gate skipping,

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.370
and was beheaded.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.580
They made us attend the execution.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:28.340
Watching that girl's head roll into a pit, I thought:

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.880
"Why didn't we stop her?"

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:35.720
You...

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.640
If it's my head you're worried about,

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.930
please don't give it a second thought.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:43.350
This is the kind of life I live now.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.790
I'll leave your change of clothes here.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:03.710
Thank you.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:07.920
Hey...

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.130
Call this off.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:14.800
I don't want anyone else to die
under our guidance.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:18.550
But...

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.020
Either way, I have to go.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:26.440
I've been trying to avenge my parents for two years.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.860
Because of my weakness,

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.440
a lot of people got dragged into it.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:35.240
I have to show it

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.280
for their sake as well.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:40.030
My unwavering determination.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.490
And as a result,

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:45.500
the moment my blade pierces my parents' murderer.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.210
The thought of skipping Kobotoke

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.880
is frightening.

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.670
But giving up on chasing that man is,

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.170
to me,

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.890
the same as throwing away my reason for living.

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.890
Miss Sato,

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:03.140
I think even if that prostitute

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.350
knew the odds against her,

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.560
she would still

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:10.770
have come knocking at this inn's door.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.240
Rin,

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.490
you're resolved to do this, aren't you?

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.120
Answer me this.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.040
Yes, of course.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:42.720
Scared after all?

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:44.560
A little...

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.020
That Sato,

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.480
she came to me this morning

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.480
suddenly saying maybe we should help you.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.110
I guess I've got no choice.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.030
Hey.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:00.860
Long time no see.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.280
Have a nice day.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:09.580
Was that okay?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:13.040
Well, those guys are from this village.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.460
The hard part starts now.

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.010
It's good to see you again.

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:21.260
Oh, Nakaya!

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.590
And that is?

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.640
This is my wife Sato's little sister.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.930
We were traveling around

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.900
from Edo to Nikko, and now we're headed back to Mino.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:34.020
Your wife's little sister?

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.480
And yet somehow

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.950
she does not have a face that really resembles
your wife's.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.570
Does she, Nakaya?

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.790
Now, now, commissioner,

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:47.870
you know,

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:52.120
there's no law saying that two sisters have to look alike.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.420
Certainly not.

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.250
So, what happened today?

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:58.880
My wife is too busy because of a guest.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:02.880
After I see her off, I was thinking of heading to Kanazawa
to put my legs up.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:05.850
A tea-shop tour while the wife is stuck with work?

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.560
A man of good character.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.850
So, anyway, do you think you could

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.690
give me a pass for her too,

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:18.150
for old time's sake?

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:21.030
About that, Nakaya...

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.660
You have a bad name when it comes to this.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.990
I've been thinking of revising the village's exceptions.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:35.500
For her to acquire an entry pass,
there would need to be a full investigation.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:39.460
Commissioner, that's just unreasonable.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:42.300
Travel expenses have been a nightmare with her.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.970
If I'm stopped again here...

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.890
Besides, what happened three years ago

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.640
is a truly bitter memory for me.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.310
If I'm not careful, I could become a criminal too.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.730
Once you see how great the risk,

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:58.150
the meager rewards aren't worth it.

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.110
I see.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:06.870
Well, it is our fault for not announcing this
until today.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:11.540
This one time, I suppose I've no choice
but to turn a blind eye.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:14.000
-My thanks!
-However,

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:17.330
instead of a note... Girl.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:21.920
I have two or three questions
about your personal circumstances.

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.090
Do you mind?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.970
Raise your head.

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:38.150
I'm sure you two know

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:41.320
about the pharmacists' killing.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.360
I have my concerns about it.

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.530
Well, that's how it is.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.280
Girl. If there's no problem, this will be over soon.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:51.580
Yes, sir.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.830
Come to think of it, I don't even know
your name or residency.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.500
Commissioner,

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.960
she's--

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.580
I'm from Takayama.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.380
My husband was born in Kozuchi, Mino.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:05.090
I'm the wife of Sobe, the son of Senkichi

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.180
of the large shop, Shimoda.

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.470
My name is Sawa.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.060
Shimoda in Mino...

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.060
Mr. Commissioner,

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:16.520
Shimoda is--

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.310
No, Nakaya.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.150
I don't need to hear anything from you this time.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:26.110
Shimoda, Shimoda...

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:29.240
Mr. Commissioner.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:31.280
That's our...

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.120
It's our census and pass transcript.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.660
I thought I'd gathered the exhaustive records

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.330
of anyone with any connection to this village...

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.840
With that said, Nakaya...

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:46.260
you are not to utter one word until you leave this place.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.220
Your "help" is truly a hindrance

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.470
in my questioning of this girl.

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:52.470
Understand?

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:57.430
It's no use. We're done for.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:00.770
Now, Sawa was it?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:04.020
According to the records, your husband, Sobe,

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:09.530
is the middle son at the
three-generation-old restaurant, Shimoda.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.950
Is your husband's shop
thriving at the moment?

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.740
Mr. Commissioner.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.000
The one who inherited Shimoda

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.710
was Senkichi of Shimoda's eldest son.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:22.790
My husband, Sobe, is in my hometown

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:25.460
of Takayama, running an inn there.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.460
I'm sure your records

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.920
will verify this.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.140
That is true.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.350
A moment ago,

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.980
you said you were traveling around Nikko,

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.810
but this piece depicts scenery

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.520
even more beautiful than the greens
of Ganmangafuchi.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:48.030
Unfortunately, Mr. Commissioner,

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:50.450
the road to Ganmangafuchi

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:54.370
will be impassible for three months
due to a landslide.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:58.580
We returned to Chuzenji
to do sightseeing and take a break.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.210
Oh, that's right.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.620
I'd forgotten about that detail.

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.750
That Shimada... He keeps on blabbering.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:09.260
But I don't understand.
What happened to your husband?

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:11.630
We couldn't close the inn.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.840
Nikko is boring on your own.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:18.600
Couldn't you have left the inn to your parents,
or even brought them with you?

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:22.140
I believe there were many options available.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.230
Mr. Commissioner...

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.230
You have countless people here before you
every day.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:33.150
I think that's a truly daunting position to be in.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:36.530
What's more, if it's all for the safety of travelers like us,

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:40.910
why would I feel the need to tell a lie?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.790
Still, your question just now...

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.540
Even knowing the circumstances,
you would ask this of me?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.750
That's...too cruel.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.720
I won't forget it.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.850
The first summer after we were married,

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:59.100
I left the inn to my husband,

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:03.140
and went on a trip to the Nikko mountains
with my parents.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.190
We were fine on the walk from Chuzenji
to the hot-springs village.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:10.900
We stayed one night at a mountain inn
near Ganmangafuchi.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.190
That was where fate took a turn.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:16.160
A sudden downpour caused the Otani River to flood,

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.910
which trapped us for two nights.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:21.040
The second day passed without
the rain showing any signs of letting up.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:24.830
We started to fear the inn might be swept away.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.380
We had to be prepared for the worst.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.000
That night, the people at the inn and I,

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.840
knowing it was do-or-die,

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:35.220
crossed a bridge in the middle of the rain,
to escape to Toshogu Shrine.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.430
But that's when I,

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:40.140
pregnant at the time,
had my feet swept out from under me

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:42.520
by the water and was thrown from the bridge.

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.890
Fortunately there was something to grab hold of,

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.230
but no way to climb up,

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.900
or be pulled up.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.230
Seeing that, my father,

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.690
and then my mother,

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.860
and soon everyone else jumped into the rapids.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:59.700
The two supported each other,

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.790
and lifted my body up from all sides.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.080
Before long,

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:08.630
I was saved by the people of the inn.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.340
My parents' bodies didn't surface from the river

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.420
until five days later,

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:15.840
far downstream on a flood bank.

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:20.550
I wasn't walking around Nikko for recreation
this time.

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.810
Rather in memoriam of my parents.

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:25.560
And to give their spirits rest...

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:28.770
I...

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.820
I'm sorry.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.240
I didn't mean to start...

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:42.030
I see. Clearly.

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:45.750
You did fit the personal description,

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:48.580
so I asked a malicious question.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.290
For those tears,

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.920
you will receive an entry pass in exchange.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.550
In other words, that means we're...

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.130
Yes. Sorry for holding you up.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.730
Sawa, wait.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:15.400
You said something interesting a moment ago.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.110
What was it?

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.950
Is your child well?

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:21.320
You just said you were pregnant.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:25.030
Yes, thankfully the two of them are in good health.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.870
That's good to hear.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:29.160
I also forgot to ask this,

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.960
that would mean you gave birth at 14?

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.380
That is correct.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.590
Fourteen, huh?

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:40.260
It must have been a very painful birth.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.050
Indeed it was.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.810
In that case, there should be evidence

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.890
of a difficult birth on your body!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.520
-Well...
-Uragami!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:53.610
I'm here.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:56.270
Bring the inspector crone to the next room.

00:19:56.360 --> 00:20:00.070
I will now inspect this woman's body.

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:03.280
-No, that's too--
-Mr. Commissioner!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.830
You need not use your methods.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:09.080
If all I've said hasn't earned your trust,

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:12.580
then I will reveal everything here before you,
Mr. Commissioner.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:26.930
My proof.

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:35.270
As you request...

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.200
My children, as per my husband's

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:44.740
and midwife's decision,

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:47.830
are children that were cut out of my womb.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:52.330
-Should I get the crone--?
-No.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.250
It's quite all right.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.300
You're a formidable woman, Sawa.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:03.130
May your travels be safe.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.010
I no longer have cause to doubt you.

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:07.720
I declare this matter concluded!

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:18.150
Hats off to you, for whatever that was.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:19.270
That was...

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.360
necessary to show him there.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.660
If at that time,

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:27.950
they had called the inspector crone,

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.200
she would've noticed

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.120
that it wasn't a scar from a real incision.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:37.500
Endure it. It's not like I'm cutting that deeply.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:38.420
Next,

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:41.500
I'll tell you everything about my little sister.

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:43.460
Memorize it in a night.

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:45.590
If we achieve our goal,

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:49.140
please start thinking about how to live happily.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.220
Doing so would let us

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:55.060
believe that we've done the right thing.

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:56.480
And that's all I ask.

00:21:58.020 --> 00:21:59.690
Well, then, this is goodbye.

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:01.070
Take care.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:03.940
I will. You do the same, Mr. Nakaya.

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:26.970
I might as well say,

00:22:27.050 --> 00:22:29.930
I can't even begin to imagine how you'd use

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:31.510
a sum of 21 ryo.

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:35.020
While it is selfish, I will be taking about half of it
for myself.

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:38.980
My husband will be getting his share too, don't worry.

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:52.760
Act Nine - Gathering
